# Full-path twin of stage.env: '||powershell' resolves only while the TS allow-list
# publication from the matrix Enforce step exists. On the restored host it comes back
# RAIL_EXEC_E_FILE_NOT_FOUND, so this is the one to hand-launch outside the Enforce window
# (owner ruling 2026-09-15 00:04 JST, option (b)). Same CMDARGS/TIMEOUT as stage.env; see
# jobs/server-snapshot.env for the full reasoning behind the full-path form.
PROGRAM='C:\Windows\System32\WindowsPowerShell\v1.0\powershell.exe'
CMDARGS='-NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \\tsclient\lab\stage.ps1'
TIMEOUT=30
